      "desktop_responsibility": "Own the Desktop Coordinator process bootstrap/carrier boundary: validate packaged process config including canonical localHumanId, classify control/data/main-data envelopes into explicit channels, queue them deterministically, and fail closed after carrier shutdown.",
      "desktop_owner": "Desktop node-agent-coordinator Carrier/CoordinatorBootstrap",
      "desktop_visible_effect": "Renderer/Host traffic cannot silently cross the wrong Coordinator channel, stale messages are discarded after shutdown, and the Coordinator receives the authenticated Human identity rather than inventing one.",
