      "ios_target_path": "source/packages/mahayana-rs/mahayana-app-host-mobile/src/lib.rs",
      "ios_language": "Rust",
      "ios_platform_delta": "Desktop process carrier is replaced by an in-process iOS carrier boundary while preserving Coordinator ownership and protocol semantics.",
      "implementation_status": "mapped",
      "production_evidence": "iOS collapses the separate Node process into the canonical in-process Mobile Host composition. Host creation/account-boundary logic owns the authenticated Human identity, typed FeatureHost/Runtime commands replace string carrier channels, and runtime/session replacement clears old-account state before new work.",
      "test_evidence": "Existing mobile Host/FeatureHost tests cover canonical local Human identity/account transition and typed Host command boundaries. Exact carrier queue/close mechanics are process-specific and are not duplicated.",
      "notes": "IOS-MAIN-COORDINATOR-CARRIER-001: exact Desktop main carrier.rs read at 3bc92400826cc4ca7ac665b467708e22261edc61. Process IPC is adapted to typed in-process modules; keep mapped pending aggregate exact-head evidence.",
